<h2 id=3D"fetch-a-url" class=3D"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:te=
xt-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:bord=
er-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">Fetch a URL<a href=3D"https://lightpa=
nda.io/docs/cloud-offer/tools/api#fetch-a-url" class=3D"x:focus-visible:nex=
tra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label=3D"Permalink for this section"></a>=
</h2>
<p class=3D"x:not-first:mt-6 x:leading-7">The main API lets you fetch a URL=
 and retrieve the rendered page in HTML or markdown format.
The <code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">POST /api/fetch</code> endpoint=
 returns a JSON message containing the page=E2=80=99s content.</p>
<h3 id=3D"request" class=3D"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-s=
late-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-8 x:text-2xl"=
>Request<a href=3D"https://lightpanda.io/docs/cloud-offer/tools/api#request=
" class=3D"x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label=3D"Pe=
rmalink for this section"></a></h3>
<p class=3D"x:not-first:mt-6 x:leading-7">The request requires the <code cl=
ass=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">Content-Type: application/json</code> heade=
r.</p>
<p class=3D"x:not-first:mt-6 x:leading-7">The endpoint accepts the followin=
g parameters:</p>
<ul class=3D"x:[:is(ol,ul)_&amp;]:my-3 x:not-first:mt-6 x:list-disc x:ms-6"=
>
<li class=3D"x:my-2"><code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">url</code>: st=
ring, required: the URL to fetch.</li>
<li class=3D"x:my-2"><code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">output_format<=
/code>: <code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">html</code> or <code class=
=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">markdown</code>, optional, default <code class=
=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">html</code>.</li>
<li class=3D"x:my-2"><code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">wait_ms</code>=
: uint, optional, default <code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">5000</cod=
e>: time to wait before retrieving the page, in milliseconds.</li>
<li class=3D"x:my-2"><code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">wait_event</co=
de>: <code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">DOMContentLoaded</code>, <code=
 class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">load</code>, <code class=3D"nextra-code"=
 dir=3D"ltr">networkAlmostIdle</code> or <code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D=
"ltr">networkIdle</code>, optional, default <code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=
=3D"ltr">networkIdle</code>: event to wait for before retrieving the page.<=
/li>
<li class=3D"x:my-2"><code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">raw</code>: bo=
ol, optional, default <code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">false</code>:=
 if true, the raw HTML or markdown is returned directly, without the JSON w=
rapper.</li>
<li class=3D"x:my-2"><code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">proxy_name</co=
de>: optional, default <code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">fast_dc</cod=
e>.</li>
<li class=3D"x:my-2"><code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">country</code>=
: optional: only used with the <code class=3D"nextra-code" dir=3D"ltr">data=
center</code> proxy.</li>
</ul>
